  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Increases in deployed AI compute enable faster processing of ISR, automated analysis and targeting models used by Ukrainian/allied intelligence and command systems, directly shortening sensor-to-decision cycles and speeding authorization and strike cadence.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
