<edge source="us_china_tech_trade::ai_infra_investment_flow" target="global_financial_fragili::etf_net_flow_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A marked uptick in new AI infrastructure funding fuels positive investor sentiment and issuance/activity in listed infra and AI-related equities, prompting retail and institutional reallocations that produce net inflows into tech and infrastructure ETFs.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade</data>
  <data key="d40">global_financial_fragili</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_tech_trade::ai_infra_investment_flow" target="russia_ukraine_war::arms_transfer_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Ramped investment into AI infrastructure—particularly in firms and supply chains in China—accelerates development and scaling of dual‑use autonomy, guidance and sensor modules that can be incorporated into munitions and exported or transferred to Russian suppliers, increasing the volume and sophistication of arms reaching the theater.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_tech_trade::ai_infra_investment_flow" target="western_political_unrest::capital_flow_volatility" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sharp reduction or sudden stop in cross‑border AI infrastructure investment (for example due to sanctions or policy restrictions) precipitates rapid portfolio rebalancing and repatriation, amplifying short‑term capital‑flow swings and FX/asset volatility.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade</data>
  <data key="d40">western_political_unrest</data>
</edge>
