  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising outstanding debt tied to large AI/data‑center projects increases refinancing and default risk for leveraged firms, widening credit spreads and triggering repricing events that raise realized and implied volatility across equities and corporate bonds.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
