  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">An increase in externally denominated infrastructure debt raises foreign‑currency servicing needs and potential capital outflow pressure, producing greater depreciation pressure on the domestic currency as FX reserves and order‑flow are strained.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_trade</data>
