  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Elevated sovereign yields push up benchmark borrowing costs and tighten lender risk appetites for long‑dated project finance, directly reducing the rate at which new debt‑backed AI/data‑center projects receive funding.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">western_political_unrest</data>
