  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Large net capital outflows from allied or regional markets force governments to prioritize financial-stability interventions and domestic crisis management, diverting political bandwidth and slowing the speed of collective military and foreign-policy decision-making related to the conflict.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
