  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A reduction in cross‑border capital inflows directly reduces availability of foreign project financing and FDI for hyperscale and colo builds, causing planned data‑center projects to be delayed, scaled back or cancelled and therefore lowering near‑term physical capacity additions.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_fragili</data>
