<edge source="global_financial_fragili::etf_net_flow_rate" target="middle_east_energy_attac::price_volatility" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Large net inflows into energy/commodity ETFs provide liquidity and absorb order imbalances, damping short-term commodity and related financial price swings, whereas rapid net outflows force liquidation of underlying futures/holdings and amplify price moves.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_fragili</data>
  <data key="d40">middle_east_energy_attac</data>
