  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Large, rapid net outflows from ETFs force correlated liquidation of underlying cross-border holdings and unwind of currency hedges, producing abrupt, higher‑frequency swings in cross-border capital movements and settlement volatility.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_fragili</data>
