  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp increases in financial market volatility prompt insurers and counterparties to raise premiums or restrict cover for high-risk routes and cargoes, driving carriers to reroute or hold vessels and thereby increasing delays and average transit times.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
