  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Spike in asset-price volatility produces uneven macroeconomic pain across allied capitals, raising domestic political pressure to protect national markets and welfare that leads some allies to resist additional coordinated costs (e.g., new sanctions or higher military spending), weakening policy alignment.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_fragili</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
