  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A spike in broad asset volatility increases lender risk premia and tightens credit terms for long‑dated project finance, causing banks and bond markets to reduce new lending for data‑center/AI builds and slowing growth of infrastructure debt outstanding.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_fragili</data>
